Claude 0.01 (26 Oct 2026)
=========================

A desktop client for Claude, using the Anthropic Messages API.

Requirements
  RISC OS 5 (desktop font text painting needs Wimp 3.80 or later).
  curl with TLS, installed from PackMan and reachable on Run$Path.
  An Anthropic API key from https://console.anthropic.com.
  A claude.ai subscription does not work here: the API bills
  per token, separately.

Use
  Click SELECT on the icon bar icon to open the conversation.
  Type in the field at the top and press Return or click Send.
  MENU over the window: Clear, Choices.
  MENU over the icon bar icon: Info, Choices, Quit.

Choices
  Saved to <Choices$Write>.Claude.Choices in plain text,
  API key included.

Limits
  Text only. No streaming, no attachments, no saved transcripts.
  The conversation lives in memory and is lost on Quit.
  Markdown shows as typed (**bold**, # headings).
  Characters outside Latin-1 show as "?".
